  <name>Goupile</name>
  <summary>Programmable electronic data capture application</summary>
  <developer id="dev.koromix">
    <name>Niels Martignène</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      Goupile is a free eCRF design tool that strives to make form creation and data entry both powerful and easy.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Create and test your forms on the fly with all kinds of widgets</li>
      <li>Enter your data and easily export it, all from the same screen</li>
      <li>Share your forms with colleagues and users to collect data</li>
      <li>Conduct your assessments on tablet or mobile, online or offline</li>
      <li>Manage your projects and users using the administration module</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The Goupile server includes the database engine (SQLite), an HTTP server and the web client in a single binary. Each project runs in its own sandboxed process.
    </p>
  </description>

